    - target: {fileID: 2298647161643049540, guid: 0222a1b4f9c504f4cb194ba535c119ea, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Text
      value: "That\u2019s Correct!\n\nSubstitute into the circular permutation formula
        for a bracelet\n\nBracelet Permutation(8) = \\frac{(8 - 1)!}{2}\n\nSimplify
        the expression\n\nBracelet Permutation(8) = \\frac{7!}{2} \n\nSubstitute
        the factorial value\n\n7! = 5040\n\nDivide\n\n\\frac{5040}{2} = 2520\n\nBracelet
        Permutation(8) = 2,520\n\nThere are 2,520 distinct arrangements of 8 colored
        beads on a bracelet with no lock."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
